@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor Visitor
actor "Verified user" as Author
actor Maintainer

rectangle "Blog Management System" {
  usecase "View home page" as UC1
  usecase "Register account" as UC2
  usecase "Sign in" as UC3
  usecase "Verify email" as UC4
  usecase "Manage own profile" as UC5
  usecase "Create draft" as UC6
  usecase "Publish post" as UC7
  usecase "Delete own account" as UC8
  usecase "Configure deployment" as UC9
  usecase "Review contributions" as UC10
}
Visitor --> UC1
Visitor --> UC2
Visitor --> UC3
Author --> UC4
Author --> UC5
Author --> UC6
Author --> UC7
Author --> UC8
Maintainer --> UC9
Maintainer --> UC10
note bottom of UC7
Post feed/detail and mutation workflows are incomplete.
Social interaction use cases are not yet implemented.
end note
@enduml
